  "seoBody": "<h2>£75 per phone number per month</h2><p>Quickler pricing is £75 per phone number per month, with a £75 monthly minimum. A phone number counts when it did at least one check in that month. Numbers that do no checks are free, so you can add everyone in your firm, from the people on the job to managers and admin, and only pay for the phone numbers doing checks. Billed monthly in arrears by UK Direct Debit.</p><h2>Free tier</h2><p>There is no time-limited trial. The free tier is how you try quickler: 10 Records a month, with up to 10 photos per Record, free forever. Sign up with no card. You only add a Direct Debit when you upgrade to a paid account because you have outgrown the free reports.</p><h2>Why per phone number and not per seat</h2><p>Most inspection software charges per seat, which means you pay for every name on the account whether they use it or not. Quickler only charges for a phone number that did at least one check that month, so a firm with twenty occasional users pays only for the handful of numbers that did checks. Here is the full reasoning on <a href=\"/pages/no-subscription-compliance.html\">only charging for the phone numbers doing checks</a>.</p><h2>Bigger teams and other countries</h2><p>Big team? <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">Talk to us</a>. Rooted in UK compliance, <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">Quickler works in any country</a> WhatsApp does, starting with the UK and reaching English-speaking markets including Ireland, the United States, Canada, Australia and New Zealand.</p><h2>Pricing questions</h2><h3>How much does Quickler cost?</h3><p>Quickler is £75 per phone number per month, with a £75 monthly minimum. A phone number counts when it did at least one check that month. Numbers that do no checks are free, and everything is unlimited on a paid account.</p><h3>Which phone numbers do I pay for?</h3><p>A phone number that did at least one check in a given month. A number that does no check that month costs nothing. You pay for the people doing checks on their phone. Everyone who gets the reports by email or uses the dashboard is free. You add your whole team and only pay for who actually works.</p><h3>Is there a free plan?</h3><p>Yes. The free forever tier gives you 10 Records a month, up to 10 photos per Record, with unlimited users and no card to start. There is no time-limited trial.</p><h3>Do I pay per seat?</h3><p>No. Most inspection software charges per seat, so you pay for every name whether they use it or not. Quickler only charges for the phone numbers doing checks, so a firm with twenty occasional users pays only for the handful who worked that month.</p><h3>How is Quickler billed?</h3><p>Monthly in arrears by UK Direct Debit. You only add a Direct Debit when you upgrade from the free tier to a paid account.</p>",
